@startuml
title WebSocket Principle (Frontend ↔ Backend, Order-based Subscription)

participant "Angular Frontend" as FE
participant "Express Backend\n(WebSocket Server)" as BE

== Open connection ==

FE -> BE: Open WebSocket connection
BE --> FE: Connection established (101 Switching Protocols)

== Subscribe to resource ==

FE -> BE: Send message\n{ orderId }
BE -> BE: ws.orderId = orderId\n(store on connection)

== Backend business event happens ==

note right of BE
Event triggered by:
- VNPay IPN
- Internal job
- Other async source
end note

BE -> BE: emitPaymentStatus(orderId, status)

== Emit to matched client ==

loop for each ws in wss.clients
    BE -> BE: if ws.orderId == orderId
    BE -> FE: WebSocket message\n{ orderId, status }
end

== Frontend handle message ==

FE -> FE: if msg.status.source == "IPN"
FE -> FE: if msg.status.status == SUCCESS / FAILED
FE -> FE: Update UI state
FE -> FE: Show alert / confirm order

== Close connection ==

FE -> BE: Close WebSocket
BE -> FE: Connection closed

@enduml
